#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 79
#: rc.cpp:13
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<h1>Keyboard Layout</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout and model. "
"The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to your computer, "
"while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" and may be different "
"for different countries."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Sleutelbord Uitleg & model</h1> Hier jy kan kies jou Sleutelbord Uitleg en "
"model. Die 'model' verwys na Die tipe van Sleutelbord wat is verbind na jou "
"rekenaar, terwyl Die Sleutelbord Uitleg definieer \"wat sleutel doen wat\" en "
"dalk mag wees ander vir ander lande."
"<p> In byvoeging na Die 'Primary Uitleg', wat sal wees gebruik word as Die "
"verstek, jy kan spesifiseer aditionele uitlegte, wat jy kan maklik wissel "
"tussen te gebruik Die Kde paneel."

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 98
#: rc.cpp:16
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Available layouts:"
msgstr "Aditionele Uitlegte"

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 106
#: rc.cpp:19
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Active layouts:"
msgstr "Aditionele Uitlegte"

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 114
#: rc.cpp:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "Keyboard &model:"
msgstr "Sleutelbord model:"

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 134
#: rc.cpp:25
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
"keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
"keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer usually "
"have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which is "
"probably what you want if you do not know what kind of keyboard you have.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies 'n sleutelbord model. Hierdie opset is onafhanklike van jou "
"sleutelbord uitleg en verwys na die \"hardeware\" model, i.e. die weg jou "
"sleutelbord is vervaardig. Moderne sleutelborde wat kom met jou rekenaar "
"gewoonlik het twee addisionele sleutels en word verwys na as \"104-key\" "
"modelle, wat is waarskynlik wat jy wil hê as jy moet nie ken wat tipe van "
"sleutelbord jy het."

