#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 192
#: rc.cpp:42
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If more than one layout is present in this list, the KDE panel will offer a "
"docked flag. By clicking on this flag you can easily switch between layouts. "
"The first layout will be default one."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies 'n arbitêre nommer van aditionele sleutelbord uitlegte. As een of "
"meer aditionele uitlegte het al gekose, die Kde paneel sal bied 'n gedok vlag. "
"Deur te kliek op hierdie vlag Jy kan maklik wissel tussen uitlegte."

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 208
#: rc.cpp:45
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Layout variant:"
msgstr "Primere wisselvorm:"

#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 220
#: rc.cpp:48
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of selected keyboard layout. Layout variants "
"usually represent different key maps for the same language. For example, "
"Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in Windows), "
"typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter is placed on "
"a transliterated latin one).\n"
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies 'n wisselvorm van die gekose aditionele sleutelbord uitleg. "
"uitleg wisselvorms gewoonlik voorstelling ander sleutel kaarte vir die selfde "
"taal. vir voorbeeld, Ukraïniese uitleg dalk het vier wisselvorms: basiese, "
"winsleutels (as in Vensters), tikmasjien (as in tikmasjiene) en fonetiese (elke "
"Ukraïniese brief is rangorde op 'n translitireerde latyn een)."

